  "title": "10 Top Colon Cancer Symptoms & Signs | UT MD Anderson",
  "description": "Colon cancer symptoms vary person to person. 1. Diarrhea or constipation 2. Change in normal bowel habits 3. Urge to have a bowel movement when there is no need 4. Pain or cramping in your lower stomach 5. Bloating 6. Change in appetite 7. Rectal bleeding 8. Blood in stool 9. Excessive fatigue 10. Weight loss without dieting",
